atrium's ui/overlay/textInput.go and ui/overlay/branchPicker.go are not on
the clean list (each carries surviving third-party lines from other atrium
contributors) and were never opened as porting sources. Two files in this
repository provide equivalent functionality as independent reimplementations
instead of ports: internal/form/widgets/textarea.go (prompt/title text
widget, built directly against charm.land/bubbles/v2's textarea) and
internal/form/field_worktree.go (worktree base-ref picker, built on this
repository's own widgets.Picker). Every other file in this repository is
original work.

